<title>ESTONIA: EMV CUM-DIVIDEND TRADE ENDS APRIL 15.</title>
<headline>EMV CUM-DIVIDEND TRADE ENDS APRIL 15.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMV construction company has fixed April 19 as the date for shareholders to register for dividends, the Tallinn stock exchange (TSE) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>April 15 is the last date for trading cum-dividends and from April 16 all trade will be ex-dividend, the TSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>The EMV board will propose the payment of a dividend of 15 kroons per share to the company's general meeting on April 19.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
